sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Customer
    participant A as Spring Boot API
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    C->>A: POST /orders with items and Idempotency-Key
    A->>D: Begin transaction; load prices and lock stock rows
    D-->>A: Current products and available quantities
    A->>D: Conditionally reserve all requested quantities
    alt All requested stock is available
        D-->>A: Reservation succeeds
        A->>D: Save order and item price snapshots
        A->>D: Commit transaction
        D-->>A: Committed order
        A-->>C: 201 Created with order
    else Any requested quantity is unavailable
        A->>D: Roll back transaction
        A-->>C: 409 Conflict; no partial order
    end
